//                                  CV > 0.15 → scale-VARIANT → frozen F2
//                                  TRIGGERED (H2.2 FALSIFIED direction).
//    F-C2-NEST-2 POSITIVE        : every scale's Φ > 0 (nested existence — a
//                                  prerequisite for "nested structure exists").
